  "note": "Incremental M30 source audit, 2026-10-22, retaining the prior independent full-audit verdict in scratch/audit-ipv6/rfc2545.json and canonical rfc/audit/rfc2545.json; untouched carriers were not reread in this increment. RFC 2545 Section 3: \"A BGP speaker shall advertise to its peer in the Network Address of Next Hop field the global IPv6 address of the next hop, potentially followed by the link-local IPv6 address of the next hop.\" Read all four scoped origination tagged wrappers and their complete testAPIOriginateIPv6NextHop and testOriginatedPolicyForwardQueue helpers. The repaired Session calls Negotiate with peerOffering(families...) on both sides, retaining capability 77 only for its explicit case and IPv4 for the mixed sibling case. peerOffering emits Multiprotocol capabilities; Negotiate intersects the offerings and defaults only an empty MP offering to classic IPv4. The actual consumer adjOutWrite.section checks Session.negotiated.SupportsFamily: the corrected offerings therefore admit legitimate IPv6 rather than silently removing it at the final writer. Exact complete-frame, error/reason, sent-count, hasAdvertised and policy-call assertions are unchanged. Invalid loopback, unspecified, multicast, native IPv4, absent and unnegotiated standalone link-local cases remain refused; the mixed case still requires the exact healthy IPv4 frame, and named commit additionally requires the later healthy IPv6 group. Mapped and capability-77 controls retain their separate family/capability contracts rather than extending the RFC quote. Read builder admission in buildBatchAnnounceUpdate, buildRIBRouteUpdate and CommitService.buildMPReachNLRI, plus effective post-policy admission in writeUpdateGated. FinalAccept is explicitly consumed by PolicyFilterChain; runEgressPolicyChainASN4 forwards raw replacement to exportFilterForBody before normalization and final validation. The queued maintenance subcase still demands two real queued items and exact healthy-sibling output. No new issue found in this incremental scope. No runtime proof, discrimination renewal, gate or stamping was run by this auditor; parent owns those results.",
